ry query in `quality.sh` has no `--no-merges` and matches loose keywords, so it may over-count. That doesn't matter yet, since the history here is too short to use.\n- The executor's friction entry is missing. Their reason is that `friction.jsonl` is outside the packet's allowed files, which conflicts with the rule in AGENTS.md. The factory or the method should settle that conflict; the executor shouldn't be penalised for it.\n- Lesson for the Atlas: the `DocService/` working directory and `NODE_CONFIG_DIR`/`NODE_ENV` settings needed to run shared `Common/` code outside the test runner. It is in the packet but not yet in the Atlas.\n\nVERDICT: APPROVE baseline written with hash, scenarios/locations, reproducible scripts, numbers, and gaps covered by spawn requests","ttft_ms":2057,"type":"result","duration_ms":18046,"uuid":"9d06b24e-4602-49a0-8ddb-be7f78ac2e10","ttft_stream_ms":951,"time_to_request_ms":379,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":7,"system_prompt":186,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":7,"input_attachments":22,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":43,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":11,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":2,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":3,"request_announcements":15,"query_setup":4,"auto_mode_context_wait":10,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":31,"message_normalization":4,"client_creation":7,"request_build":13},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":94,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":239,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":214,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":139,"process_rss_mib_result":226,"process_anon_mib_result":138,"process_peak_rss_mib":261,"process_cpu_ms_turn":1140,"process_wall_ms_turn":18046,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":463,"process_wall_ms_streaming":14612,"main_stream_count":5,"main_stream_event_count":273,"main_stream_chunk_count":83,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_p